# Vendored ONNX model weights (~64 MB), fetched by `pnpm fetch-models`.
# Not committed: they are large binaries reproducible from a pinned script, and
# git is the wrong place for them. The generated fingerprints in
# packages/core/src/model-fingerprints.ts ARE committed, so a mismatch between
# the weights someone fetches and the index in the repo is detected at load.
